{"id":"875e72f69ea30655","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-conditional-condition-semantics.md","title":"半等式、可汇合与定向条件","display":"df-conditional-condition-semantics — 半等式、可汇合与定向条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-conditional-condition-semantics","aliases":["56-df-conditional-condition-semantics"],"display":"df-conditional-condition-semantics — 半等式、可汇合与定向条件","depends_on":["[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-df-joinable]]"],"source_section":"§3.5 Definition 3.5.3","source_printed_pages":"82","source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; mode-coding-local","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-conditional-condition-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-conditional-condition-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conditional-condition-semantics — 半等式、可汇合与定向条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.5 Definition 3.5.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; mode-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq T^2\">\\(X\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{-1}\">\\(X^{-1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a>。本节点引入谓词符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\\)</span>，其定义在Assertion中给出。模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2\">\\(0,1,2\\)</span> 分别编码转换条件、可汇合条件、定向有限归约条件；模式2本身不包含对右侧目标的正规形要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\\iff{}&amp;\n(m=0\\land(s,t)\\in(X\\cup X^{-1})^*)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(m=1\\land\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(m=2\\land(s,t)\\in X^*).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\\iff{}&amp;\n(m=0\\land(s,t)\\in(X\\cup X^{-1})^*)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(m=1\\land\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(m=2\\land(s,t)\\in X^*).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.5.3（印刷第82页）区分 semi-equational、join、normal 三类系统。前两类分别使用模式0、1；normal类还要求模式2的右端为删除条件后的无条件系统的基项正规形，该限制另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a>。所以这里把模式2称为定向条件，不把任意定向条件系统误称为原书的normal系统。</p>\n<p>本节点是实际读过的三种条件的共同编码。去重范围为本书目录；旧 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a8ab98bbdc29f05\" href=\"?note=2a8ab98bbdc29f05\" title=\"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step\">56-df-conditional-rewrite-step</a> 只定义模式0的完整系统语义，不能承担模式1、2的接口。此处仅形式化条件满足，不定义规则生成关系，避免与后续分层构造形成循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 为集合，$X\\subseteq T^2$，$s,t\\in T$，$m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。$X^*$、$X^{-1}$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]，$\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。本节点引入谓词符号 $\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)$，其定义在Assertion中给出。模式 $0,1,2$ 分别编码转换条件、可汇合条件、定向有限归约条件；模式2本身不包含对右侧目标的正规形要求。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 为集合，$X\\subseteq T^2$，$s,t\\in T$，$m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。$X^*$、$X^{-1}$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]，$\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。本节点引入谓词符号 $\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)$，其定义在Assertion中给出。模式 $0,1,2$ 分别编码转换条件、可汇合条件、定向有限归约条件；模式2本身不包含对右侧目标的正规形要求。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition 3.5.3（印刷第82页）区分 semi-equational、join、normal 三类系统。前两类分别使用模式0、1；normal类还要求模式2的右端为删除条件后的无条件系统的基项正规形，该限制另见 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]。所以这里把模式2称为定向条件，不把任意定向条件系统误称为原书的normal系统。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"2a8ab98bbdc29f05","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本节点是实际读过的三种条件的共同编码。去重范围为本书目录；旧 [[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step]] 只定义模式0的完整系统语义，不能承担模式1、2的接口。此处仅形式化条件满足，不定义规则生成关系，避免与后续分层构造形成循环。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"X^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\\iff{}&\n(m=0\\land(s,t)\\in(X\\cup X^{-1})^*)\\\\\n&\\lor(m=1\\land\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t))\\\\\n&\\lor(m=2\\land(s,t)\\in X^*).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1941,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-conditional-condition-semantics.md]]"}],"outgoing":["9ddd157960e9574a","1de67f45113d6dcf","b1c8fb0e112e49fa","2a8ab98bbdc29f05"]}